      "refersTo": "rail",
      "description": "Actual 32 px rail and source Lucide paths, with disabled future tools.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\" aria-label=\"G25 tools\"><button class=\"ds-rail-icon ds-current\" aria-label=\"G25 PCA\" aria-current=\"page\" title=\"G25 PCA\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"5.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"11.5\" cy=\"11.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-rail-icon\" aria-label=\"G25 distances — planned\" title=\"G25 distances — planned\" disabled><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l2.6-2.6a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"m14.5 12.5 2-2m-5-1 2-2m-5-1 2-2m7 11 2-2\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-rail-icon\" aria-label=\"G25 models — planned\" title=\"G25 models — planned\" disabled><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"/><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"/><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{width:var(--rail-width,32px);flex:0 0 var(--rail-width,32px);background:var(--rail,#24272b);padding-top:5px}.ds-rail-icon{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:36px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#c8d0db;padding:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-rail-icon.ds-current{background:var(--rail-current,#3a4048);color:#fff}.ds-rail-icon:disabled{color:#929dac;cursor:default}.ds-rail-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #007bff;outline-offset:-2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "X/Y component selectors",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "axis-select",
      "description": "Actual 11 px axis labels and 12 px, 68×29 px Bootstrap selects.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-components\" aria-label=\"Custom PCA components\"><label><span>X</span><select class=\"ds-select\" aria-label=\"Horizontal component\" title=\"PC1\"><option selected>PC1</option><option disabled>PC2</option></select></label><label><span>Y</span><select class=\"ds-select\" aria-label=\"Vertical component\" title=\"PC2\"><option disabled>PC1</option><option selected>PC2</option></select></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-components{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid #ced4da;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da}.ds-components label{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Noto Sans\", \"Liberation Sans\", sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\";font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:11px;color:#6c757d;margin:0}.ds-select{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Noto Sans\", \"Liberation Sans\", sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\";font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;display:inline-block;width:68px;height:29px;padding:3px 1.75rem 3px .5rem;font-size:12px;color:#495057;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='4' height='5' viewBox='0 0 4 5'%3e%3cpath fill='%23343a40' d='M2 0L0 2h4zm0 5L0 3h4z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e\") right .75rem center/8px 10px no-repeat;border:0;border-radius:.25rem;appearance:none}.ds-select:focus{border-color:#80bdff;outline:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 .2rem rgba(0,123,255,.25)}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #007bff;outline-offset:1px;}.ds-select:disabled{color:#6c757d;background-color:#e9ecef}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "G25 Views' Custom PCA workspace",
    "overview": "G25 tools follows the user-pinned G25 Views Custom PCA interface: source-sized Bootstrap controls above one white, viewport-filling Plotly chart. This approved replacement preserves the reference's density, SVG hover tools and native chart behavior.\n\nThe only visual additions are the thin charcoal icon rail, compact component selectors and PCA_views' outlined marks, with the original marker appearance retained. Data supplies the color; interface structure stays restrained.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "32 px icon-only rail; 47 px input strip; 31 px controls.",
      "Native hover modebar with original G25 Custom SVG icons.",
      "White chart, faint ticks, light grid and source margins.",
      "Bootstrap system typography for controls; native Plotly typography for the graph."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Source Fidelity",
        "body": "Preserve the pinned Custom PCA composition, control sizing and native hover toolbar.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "Data Color",
        "body": "Use marker palettes for group identity; keep interface chrome in Bootstrap blue and neutral gray.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain the 32 px rail, 47 px strip and viewport-filling chart at supported desktop widths.",
      "Do preserve the original SVG tools, compact dropdowns and native chart interactions.",
      "Do keep individual points, outlined group marks and the selectable original G25 appearance.",
      "Do keep the last valid plot visible when coordinate validation fails."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reintroduce the rejected dashboard shell, separate coordinate panel, permanent plot toolbar or footer.",
      "Don't add settings dialogs, regional PCA features or mobile layouts to this approved surface.",
      "Don't replace Bootstrap system typography or source-pinned faint ticks with the previous design tokens."
    ]
  }
}
